@startuml mcp-proxy-e2e-sequence
!theme plain
title mcp-proxy 端到端主流程时序图（订阅 → 就绪 → MCP 操控 → 退订）

actor "用户 Agent" as agent
participant "auth-validator\n(统一认证服务)" as validator
participant "mcp-proxy\n(网关 :8080)" as proxy
database "MySQL\nt_cloud_phone_instance" as mysql
database "Redis\nmcp:route:{id}" as redis
participant "云手机 mcp-server\n(mcp_mobile_use)" as phone

== 1. 订阅与准备 ==
agent -> validator: POST /api/token/issue {uid, instanceId}
validator --> agent: tmp token（10s 有效）

agent -> proxy: POST /api/v1/instances/create\n(x-auth-token)
proxy -> validator: 校验临时 token
validator --> proxy: {valid, uid, instanceId}
proxy -> mysql: INSERT 实例（status=CREATED）
mysql --> proxy: ok
proxy --> agent: {orderId, instanceId}

agent -> proxy: POST /api/v1/instances/prepare
proxy -> mysql: UPDATE status=PREPARING, waitingCount=3
proxy --> agent: {status_list}

== 2. 轮询就绪 + 判活 ==
loop 每隔几秒直到 status==0
  agent -> proxy: POST /api/v1/instances/prepare-progress
  proxy -> mysql: waitingCount--
  alt waitingCount 归零
    proxy -> proxy: fetchAccessInfo(instanceId)\n(E4 取 ip+mcp_port)
    proxy -> mysql: UPDATE mcp_ip/mcp_port 落库
    proxy -> phone: GET /healthz 判活
    alt 2xx
      proxy -> mysql: status=NORMAL, healthy=true
    else 失败
      proxy -> mysql: status=FAILED, healthy=false
    end
  end
  proxy --> agent: {status, waitingCount}
end

== 3. 登录换 JWT ==
agent -> proxy: POST /api/auth/login {token}
proxy -> validator: 校验临时 token
validator --> proxy: {valid, uid, instanceId}
proxy --> agent: 30min JWT（RS256, uid+instanceId）

== 4. MCP 代理（三传输同决策链） ==
agent -> proxy: POST /mcp/{instanceId}\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
proxy -> proxy: 验签 + instanceId 比对 + 归属校验 + 就绪门控
alt 校验通过
  proxy -> redis: GET mcp:route:{id}
  alt 缓存命中
    redis --> proxy: ip:port（续期 30min）
  else 未命中
    proxy -> mysql: 查 mcp_ip/mcp_port（无则 E4 获取落库）
    proxy -> redis: SET 缓存 TTL=30min
  end
  proxy -> phone: POST /mcp（携带同一用户 JWT）
  phone -> phone: 预置公钥验签（RS256）
  phone --> proxy: JSON-RPC 响应
  proxy --> agent: 透传响应
else 失败
  proxy --> agent: 401 / 403 / 404 / 409
end

note over proxy, phone
  活跃期探活：SSE/WS 长连接存续 或 3min 内有 MCP 请求
  → 每 30s GET /healthz，更新 MySQL healthy
end note

== 5. 续期与退订 ==
agent -> proxy: POST /api/auth/exchange {旧JWT}
proxy --> agent: 新 30min JWT（同 uid/instanceId）

agent -> proxy: POST /api/v1/instances/delete
proxy -> mysql: UPDATE status=DELETED（逻辑删除）
proxy -> redis: DEL mcp:route:{id}
proxy --> agent: OK
@enduml
